OL,3,ANew Yorkers were 'lied' to about toxic
OL,4,Aair after 9/11 attacks, says Mamdani
OL,5,
OL,6,FToxic air quality was being recorded in
OL,7,FManhattan soon after the 9/11 attacks,
OL,8,Feven as officials played down the
OL,9,Fhealth risks to the public, according
OL,10,Fto a trove of newly released files.
OL,12,FNew York City Mayor Zohran Mamdani said
OL,13,Fthe 170,000 documents show asbestos was
OL,14,Ffound "nearly everywhere" they tested
OL,15,Fnear Ground Zero, the site where the
OL,16,FWorld Trade Center towers collapsed in
OL,17,F2001.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
