OL,3,ANew Yorkers were 'lied' to about toxic
OL,4,Aair after 9/11 attacks, says Mamdani
OL,5,
OL,6,F"People got sick because the leaders
OL,7,Fthey trusted lied and told them they
OL,8,Fwere safe to breathe in toxic air,"
OL,9,FMamdani said at a news conference with
OL,10,Fsurvivors.
OL,12,FIllnesses related to the dust and smoke
OL,13,Ffrom the collapse of the Twin Towers
OL,14,Fhave claimed more lives than the
OL,15,Fattacks themselves, US health officials
OL,16,Fsay.
